Z||000002||Oreif||05-31-2000||02:25 AM||||I don't know how you would do that on the plastic ones, Why not find a set from an 84. They are glass and you can use a normal chemical paint stripper to remove it from the glass. The 84's will fit all later notchback Fiero's as long as you get the bracket that goes on the left side of the window. I have 84 SE panels (glass) on my 86 SE.||||reg||1
